{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t國家統計局表示，內地就業形勢總體穩定，城鎮調查失業率下降。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n數據顯示，9月全國城鎮調查失業率、31個大城市城鎮調查失業率均為5.2%，較8月跌0.1個百分點。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n首3季，全國城鎮調查失業率平均值為5.2%，與去年同期持平。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T02:39:04.368879+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T02:28:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T15:18:11.837559+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T02:37:34.594635+00:00","content_hash":"260e19fc5772025a506a06c4f2194bf2c9e4a853c4bb33ad72b0c65fa0676b25","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}